{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X在S09把‘想在难受时有人陪’推成了‘怕孤单到连那些气也肯再受’，解释稍显武断；Y的动机表达更开放、自然。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的重点句有明确视觉层级，关键动机一眼能抓住；感受分时出现，不必同时处理一大堆短词，而且音乐的情绪变化有了先后顺序，细节也更具体，能感到情绪如何从一个状态转向另一个状态。Y的优势是叙事解释更完整、更口语自然，尤其人物为什么犹豫、为什么舍不得，交代得更充分；但右侧大量短词同时出现，容易形成情绪词堆叠，前后变化也不如X容易跟随。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "20b331bb-2d83-4c93-b838-1611c42ab82e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T001023956089Z", "elapsed_seconds": 65.297, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:11:29.257155+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ad5ea20cf8dce07e35bda71bc9c78e1bfba134d8c3d978e4a36b08095f338253", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.